#question(title: [Trig suprema])[
  Let $f(x) = sin x$.  \
  Find four open intervals $I_1$, $I_2$,
  $I_3$, $I_4$ such that

  + $f$ has a supremum and an infimum on
    $I_1$.
  + $f$ has a supremum and no infimum on
    $I_2$.
  + $f$ has a maximum and a minimum on $I_3$.
  + $f$ has a maximum and no minimum on
    $I_4$.
]
